BOOKING RESCHEDULED
===================

Hello <%= @booking.user.email %>,

Your booking has been successfully rescheduled.

Booking ID: #<%= @booking.id %>

Route:
<%= @booking.trip.from_city %> → <%= @booking.trip.to_city %>

Operator:
<%= @booking.trip.operator.name %>

Bus:
<%= @booking.trip.bus.name %>

New Departure:
<%= @booking.trip.departure_at.strftime("%d %b %Y, %I:%M %p") %>

Seats:
<%= @booking.booking_seats.map { |booking_seat|
  booking_seat.trip_seat.seat.seat_number
}.join(", ") %>

Updated Amount:
₹<%= @booking.total_amount %>
